OL,3,GNEWSAAirport workers to strike for two
OL,4,Adays over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers at Leeds Bradford Airport (LBA)
OL,7,Fare set to go on a two-day strike in a
OL,8,Fbattle over pay for around 130 staff.
OL,10,FThe Unite members - a mixture of air
OL,11,Ftraffic control workers, customer
OL,12,Fexperience staff, security staff and
OL,13,Fcleaners - are due to walk out between
OL,14,F16-18 October.
OL,16,FTheir wages have fallen behind other
OL,17,Fairports such as Newcastle in
OL,18,Fequivalent roles, said the union, which
OL,19,Fclaimed the action would temporarily
OL,20,Fclose the airport.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
