OL,3,GNEWSAAirport workers to strike for two
OL,4,Adays over pay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the airport said it
OL,7,Fhad made "a fair and responsible" offer
OL,8,Fthat was "significantly" above
OL,9,Finflation and "anticipated running
OL,10,Fnear-normal operations" if the strike
OL,11,Fwent ahead.
